{
 "lessonId": "lesson-25-react-basics",
 "allow": [
  "jsx"
 ],
 "topic": {
  "ru": "React: компоненты и props",
  "uz": "React: komponentlar va props",
  "en": "React: components and props"
 },
 "sections": {
  "0": {
   "title": {
    "ru": "Компонент",
    "uz": "Komponent",
    "en": "A component"
   },
   "intro": {
    "ru": "Первый компонент — функция, которая возвращает JSX.",
    "uz": "Birinchi komponent — JSX qaytaradigan funksiya.",
    "en": "The first component is a function that returns JSX."
   },
   "files": {
    "App.jsx": ""
   },
   "steps": [
    {
     "file": "App.jsx",
     "re": "function\\s+App\\s*\\(\\s*\\)\\s*\\{[\\s\\S]*return\\s*\\(?\\s*<",
     "say": {
      "ru": "`function App() { return <h1>Привет, React!</h1>; }`",
      "uz": "`function App() { return <h1>Salom, React!</h1>; }`",
      "en": "`function App() { return <h1>Hello, React!</h1>; }`"
     },
     "show": "function App() {\n  return <h1>Привет, React!</h1>;\n}"
    },
    {
     "file": "App.jsx",
     "re": "export\\s+default\\s+App",
     "say": {
      "ru": "Экспортируй: `export default App;`",
      "uz": "Eksport qil: `export default App;`",
      "en": "Export it: `export default App;`"
     },
     "show": "export default App;"
    }
   ],
   "open": "App.jsx"
  },
  "2": {
   "title": {
    "ru": "props",
    "uz": "props",
    "en": "props"
   },
   "intro": {
    "ru": "Компонент-карточка с данными через props.",
    "uz": "Props orqali ma'lumot oladigan kartochka-komponent.",
    "en": "A card component that gets data through props."
   },
   "files": {
    "App.jsx": "function App() {\n  return (\n    <div>\n      \n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default App;\n"
   },
   "steps": [
    {
     "file": "App.jsx",
     "re": "function\\s+Card\\s*\\(\\s*(props|\\{\\s*\\w+[^}]*\\})\\s*\\)",
     "say": {
      "ru": "`function Card({ title, price }) { … }`",
      "uz": "`function Card({ title, price }) { … }`",
      "en": "`function Card({ title, price }) { … }`"
     },
     "show": "function Card({ title, price }) {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"card\">\n      <h3>{title}</h3>\n      <p>{price}</p>\n    </div>\n  );\n}"
    },
    {
     "file": "App.jsx",
     "re": "className=",
     "say": {
      "ru": "В JSX вместо class пишут `className`",
      "uz": "JSX da class o'rniga `className` yoziladi",
      "en": "In JSX use `className` instead of class"
     },
     "show": "<div className=\"card\">"
    },
    {
     "file": "App.jsx",
     "re": "(<Card\\s+[^>]*title=[^>]*/>[\\s\\S]*){2}",
     "say": {
      "ru": "Используй дважды: `<Card title=\"Кроссовки\" price=\"450 000\" />`",
      "uz": "Ikki marta ishlat: `<Card title=\"Krossovka\" price=\"450 000\" />`",
      "en": "Use it twice: `<Card title=\"Sneakers\" price=\"450 000\" />`"
     },
     "show": "<Card title=\"Кроссовки\" price=\"450 000\" />\n<Card title=\"Кепка\" price=\"90 000\" />"
    }
   ],
   "open": "App.jsx"
  }
 },
 "homework": {
  "title": {
   "ru": "Лендинг на компонентах",
   "uz": "Komponentlardagi lending",
   "en": "Landing in components"
  },
  "intro": {
   "ru": "Разбей лендинг на компоненты Header, Hero, Features, Footer — каждый в своём файле.",
   "uz": "Lendingni Header, Hero, Features, Footer komponentlariga ajrat — har biri o'z faylida.",
   "en": "Split the landing into Header, Hero, Features, Footer components — each in its own file."
  },
  "files": {
   "App.jsx": "function App() {\n  return (\n    <>\n      \n    </>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default App;\n",
   "Header.jsx": ""
  },
  "steps": [
   {
    "file": "Header.jsx",
    "re": "function\\s+Header\\s*\\(\\s*\\)[\\s\\S]*<header[\\s\\S]*export\\s+default\\s+Header",
    "say": {
     "ru": "Header.jsx: компонент с `<header>` и `export default Header;`",
     "uz": "Header.jsx: `<header>` li komponent va `export default Header;`",
     "en": "Header.jsx: a component with `<header>` and `export default Header;`"
    },
    "show": "function Header() {\n  return <header>Логотип</header>;\n}\n\nexport default Header;"
   },
   {
    "file": "App.jsx",
    "re": "import\\s+Header\\s+from\\s+[\"\\']\\./Header(\\.jsx)?[\"\\']",
    "say": {
     "ru": "В App.jsx: `import Header from \"./Header\";`",
     "uz": "App.jsx da: `import Header from \"./Header\";`",
     "en": "In App.jsx: `import Header from \"./Header\";`"
    },
    "show": "import Header from \"./Header\";"
   },
   {
    "file": "App.jsx",
    "re": "import\\s+(Hero|Features|Footer)\\s+from[\\s\\S]*import\\s+(Hero|Features|Footer)\\s+from[\\s\\S]*import\\s+(Hero|Features|Footer)\\s+from",
    "say": {
     "ru": "Создай файлы Hero, Features, Footer (кнопка ＋) и импортируй их",
     "uz": "Hero, Features, Footer fayllarini yarat (＋ tugmasi) va ularni import qil",
     "en": "Create Hero, Features, Footer files (the ＋ button) and import them"
    },
    "show": "import Hero from \"./Hero\";\nimport Features from \"./Features\";\nimport Footer from \"./Footer\";"
   },
   {
    "file": "App.jsx",
    "re": "<Header\\s*/>[\\s\\S]*<Hero\\s*/>[\\s\\S]*<Features\\s*/>[\\s\\S]*<Footer\\s*/>",
    "say": {
     "ru": "Собери в App: `<Header /> <Hero /> <Features /> <Footer />`",
     "uz": "App da yig': `<Header /> <Hero /> <Features /> <Footer />`",
     "en": "Put it together in App: `<Header /> <Hero /> <Features /> <Footer />`"
    },
    "show": "<Header />\n<Hero />\n<Features />\n<Footer />"
   }
  ],
  "open": "App.jsx",
  "extra": [
   "Hero.jsx",
   "Features.jsx",
   "Footer.jsx"
  ]
 }
}
